WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.399
Week 21: Direct and Indirect Objects. track who receives what avoid unnecessary repetition clarify a transaction

2
00:00:08.399 --> 00:00:29.820
Read for the situation. La oficina envió dos paquetes, pero el mensajero los entregó a destinatarios equivocados. La gerente les explicó el error y pidió que se los devolvieran. The office sent two packages, but the courier delivered them to the wrong recipients. The manager explained the error to them and asked them to return the packages.

3
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:38.454
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:38.454 --> 00:00:45.424
Reading activities. Reading activity 49; Reading activity 50; Reading activity 51

5
00:00:45.424 --> 00:00:53.311
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:53.311 --> 00:01:18.865
Model language. Le envié el mensaje esta mañana. — I sent him or her the message this morning. El paquete lo recibió otra persona. — Someone else received the package. ¿Puedes mostrármelo? — Can you show it to me? No les expliqué el cambio. — I did not explain the change to them. Devuélvale los documentos al gerente. — Return the documents to the manager.

7
00:01:18.865 --> 00:01:28.763
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
